WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 af9be30c5242833f98ea72c9f5629b27

00:00:00.486 --> 00:00:02.406
Habari. Karibu kwenye uchambuzi mwingine wa kina.

00:00:02.406 --> 00:00:06.006
Safari hii tunaangalia zoezi la
wingu, mvua na jua.

00:00:07.285 --> 00:00:11.846
Hili ni zoezi ambalo watu wengi
huliona kuwa linakatisha tamaa sana,

00:00:13.445 --> 00:00:14.486
kwa sababu,

00:00:16.405 --> 00:00:21.686
nadhani ni vigumu zaidi kupunguza
kasi na kuona mambo waziwazi akilini.

00:00:21.765 --> 00:00:24.606
Lakini nadhani kwa sababu hiyo,
ni zoezi lenye manufaa makubwa pia.

00:00:25.955 --> 00:00:28.475
Kwa hiyo ni zoezi rahisi la kuchora.

00:00:28.475 --> 00:00:32.835
Unachora tu kwa duaradufu,
duara na mstatili.

00:00:33.206 --> 00:00:35.036
Hebu nikuonyeshe jinsi ningelifanya.

00:00:35.036 --> 00:00:36.595
Sitatumia muda mrefu sana kwenye hili.

00:00:37.225 --> 00:00:39.716
Lakini natumaini itakusaidia kuliona.

00:00:39.716 --> 00:00:43.115
Jambo moja la kuzingatia mwanzoni
ni kwamba tuna mstari huu hapa,

00:00:43.115 --> 00:00:46.756
ambao umefifia rangi na una
alama hii ya kufuli kando yake.

00:00:47.316 --> 00:00:49.716
Utaiona mistari kama hii
katika mazoezi yote, pale ambapo

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:52.515
kuna kipande cha msimbo nimekupa
ambacho nadhani ni muhimu sana

00:00:53.155 --> 00:00:57.216
uwe nacho. Labda katika hili,
ni vigumu sana kukigundua.

00:00:57.576 --> 00:01:00.735
Na pia, kwa kweli,
haiwezekani kukigundua.

00:01:01.615 --> 00:01:03.536
Kuna mistatili tofauti inayofaa.

00:01:03.695 --> 00:01:05.456
Kwa hiyo nimekupa hiki ili kuhakikisha

00:01:05.775 --> 00:01:08.096
kwamba hujikwai kwa sababu yake.

00:01:08.956 --> 00:01:11.695
Kwa hiyo ukiiona, hiyo ndiyo sababu.

00:01:12.036 --> 00:01:14.656
Lakini tuanze. Tuweke duara.

00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:18.495
Kila mara tuna vitendakazi
hivi hapa chini.

00:01:19.135 --> 00:01:21.936
Baadaye tutakuwa na metodu pia,
nitakapokufundisha metodu ni nini.

00:01:22.256 --> 00:01:26.085
Duara lina kitovu X,
kitovu Y, nusukipenyo na rangi.

00:01:26.796 --> 00:01:30.835
Kwa hiyo kitovu X. Tunakuja huku,
na nadhani tulisema hapa, ndiyo,

00:01:30.835 --> 00:01:34.835
kila kitu kinagawanyika kwa tano. Kwa hiyo
tunakuja huku na tunataka tu kupata

00:01:34.835 --> 00:01:40.236
kitovu cha duara hili. Na tunaona
kwamba kitovu hicho ni 75 kwa 30.

00:01:40.956 --> 00:01:46.796
Na tunaona kwamba umbali
kutoka hapa hadi hapa ni 15.

00:01:47.756 --> 00:01:51.115
Na tunaona kwamba duara hili ni la njano.

00:01:54.245 --> 00:01:57.965
Kwa hiyo tukiendesha hivi, tunaona sasa
tuna duara la njano mahali sahihi.

00:01:57.965 --> 00:01:58.805
Na tuna huu,

00:01:59.846 --> 00:02:01.846
mstatili. Na tunaona kwamba hiki cha kushoto,

00:02:02.085 --> 00:02:04.725
kipande cha wingu cha kushoto hapa
hakiko mahali sahihi.

00:02:05.126 --> 00:02:07.646
Kwa hiyo tufanye hivi. Ni vilevile.

00:02:07.646 --> 00:02:11.045
Tuna duara. Tunataka kupata
kitovu cha duara hili.

00:02:11.126 --> 00:02:15.045
Kwa macho yangu inaonekana ni 25, 50,

00:02:16.246 --> 00:02:20.346
na kwamba umbali huu
kutoka hapa hadi hapa ni 10

00:02:21.225 --> 00:02:26.746
na kwamba hili ni jeupe. Tunafanya hivi,
na limekaa mahali sahihi.

00:02:27.306 --> 00:02:30.586
Duara hili linalofuata tunaona
linazunguka hapa.

00:02:31.145 --> 00:02:35.466
Kwa hiyo kitovu chake kiko
karibu hapa, kwa macho yangu.

00:02:35.466 --> 00:02:36.586
Kwa hiyo 40, 40.

00:02:38.265 --> 00:02:41.225
Na sijafanya zoezi hili
kwa takriban

00:02:42.265 --> 00:02:45.626
miezi mitatu, minne. Kwa hiyo sijui
kabisa kama niko sahihi na

00:02:45.626 --> 00:02:49.906
viwianishi hivi. Tutaona. Lakini natumaini
sijakosea sana.

00:02:50.945 --> 00:02:53.346
Kwa hiyo nasema ni 40, 40, 15,

00:02:55.985 --> 00:02:58.985
na inaonekana kuwa sahihi. Na nadhani
inakuwa vigumu kidogo zaidi,

00:02:58.985 --> 00:03:00.786
kwa sababu maduara mengi zaidi yanaingia.

00:03:01.186 --> 00:03:04.786
Kwa hiyo unaweza kila mara kurudi
nyuma kidogo pia, ili tu, hapa,

00:03:05.346 --> 00:03:07.466
ujaribu kuona vitu hivi viko wapi.

00:03:07.466 --> 00:03:09.026
Hili labda ndilo gumu zaidi.

00:03:09.026 --> 00:03:12.385
Lakini natumaini unaweza kuliona akilini
duara hili hapa, hivi.

00:03:12.705 --> 00:03:16.705
Hivyo ndivyo ninavyofanya. Na kwa kuliona
akilini, nasema kitovu kiko karibu hapa,

00:03:16.786 --> 00:03:18.385
kwa hiyo 55, 40.

00:03:22.866 --> 00:03:31.186
Na kutoka 40, nitasema kwamba ni 40
juu hadi 20, kwa hiyo nusukipenyo cha takriban 20.

00:03:32.225 --> 00:03:35.985
Na sasa tunatarajia hili
libadilike tukiendesha,

00:03:36.705 --> 00:03:38.385
na linabadilika. Kwa hiyo hilo lilikuwa sahihi.

00:03:38.385 --> 00:03:40.626
Kama tungekosea, kama
ingekuwa kama 15,

00:03:41.355 --> 00:03:42.795
basi hili lingebaki vilevile.

00:03:42.795 --> 00:03:46.156
Na ungeona, natumaini,
kwamba hili si kubwa vya kutosha.

00:03:46.556 --> 00:03:50.116
Na labda katika hali hiyo
pia ni rahisi zaidi

00:03:50.116 --> 00:03:53.836
kuifanya mistari hii miwili kuwa maoni, kisha
kuona kwamba hili limepotoka kidogo.

00:03:55.036 --> 00:03:57.795
Usiogope kamwe kuufanya msimbo kuwa maoni.

00:03:57.795 --> 00:04:01.436
Utakuta hivi si katika mazoezi ya kuchora tu,
bali katika mambo ya kila aina,

00:04:01.915 --> 00:04:05.915
ambapo mara nyingi unafanya baadhi ya sehemu
kuwa maoni ili uzingatie sehemu nyingine.

00:04:05.915 --> 00:04:06.635
Inafanya kazi vizuri sana.

00:04:07.686 --> 00:04:11.765
Hata hivyo, duara la mwisho. Hebu
nirudishe hili jinsi lilivyokuwa.

00:04:11.765 --> 00:04:16.326
20. Hebu tukate hili. Sawa, kwa hiyo 20.

00:04:16.966 --> 00:04:22.725
Na tena, hili liko huku. Kwa hiyo unaona
kwamba, kwa kweli, hili lina ulinganifu.

00:04:23.125 --> 00:04:25.605
Kwa hiyo unaona litafanana
na lile la kwanza.

00:04:26.805 --> 00:04:28.886
Ila tu liko upande mwingine.

00:04:29.286 --> 00:04:31.125
Kwa hiyo sasa tunajua mengi kuhusu ulinganifu.

00:04:31.846 --> 00:04:34.886
Na tunaweza kusema, sawa,
wingu hili sasa liko hapa hivi.

00:04:35.906 --> 00:04:37.625
Na tunaweza kuangalia matone haya ya mvua.

00:04:37.625 --> 00:04:40.146
Kwa hiyo matone ya mvua. Ellipsis.

00:04:41.425 --> 00:04:45.665
Duaradufu kila mara ni ngumu kidogo zaidi
kwa sababu ina nusukipenyo cha mlalo na cha wima.

00:04:45.826 --> 00:04:50.065
Lakini tunajua kwamba nusukipenyo
cha mlalo ni miraba mitatu kati ya hii.

00:04:50.065 --> 00:04:53.185
Nilikupa hilo. Kwa hiyo nusukipenyo X ni 3.

00:04:53.505 --> 00:04:57.985
Na nina uhakika kabisa hiki kitakuwa 5
kwa sababu kinaonekana kikubwa kidogo zaidi.

00:04:57.985 --> 00:04:59.586
Na tunajua haya ni ya bluu.

00:05:02.315 --> 00:05:02.555
Kwa hiyo

00:05:03.915 --> 00:05:04.475
hebu

00:05:05.276 --> 00:05:08.036
tupate nafasi zake. Na tena,
hili ni rahisi kabisa.

00:05:08.036 --> 00:05:11.036
Unaweza kupima tu. Kwa hiyo hili ni 30, 70.

00:05:11.995 --> 00:05:16.475
Na siwezi kamwe kuandika ellipse sawasawa.
Kila mara naiita ellipsis.

00:05:17.036 --> 00:05:17.755
Kwa hiyo ndivyo hivyo.

00:05:19.036 --> 00:05:21.596
Na kwa hiyo tuna matone haya matano ya mvua.

00:05:21.596 --> 00:05:22.716
Hebu tuweke yote matano.

00:05:23.516 --> 00:05:25.995
Na tunajua kwamba 1, 2, 3 ni sawa.

00:05:26.315 --> 00:05:30.475
Kwa hiyo tukifanya haya ya juu kwanza,
tunajua kitu pekee kinachobadilika ni X.

00:05:30.716 --> 00:05:33.255
Tunajua la kwanza ni 30, linalofuata ni 50,

00:05:33.415 --> 00:05:38.279
na kwa hiyo tunaweza kukisia kwa uhakika
kwamba hili linalofuata si 80, ni 70.

00:05:38.391 --> 00:05:41.576
50 jumlisha 20. Na tunaona
kwamba haya yako katikati.

00:05:41.735 --> 00:05:45.175
Kwa hiyo kwa mantiki kidogo tunajua
kwamba haya yatakuwa 40 na 60,

00:05:45.576 --> 00:05:49.016
na tunaweza kupima hili ili kuona
kwamba haya yatakuwa 80

00:05:49.896 --> 00:05:51.975
na natumaini ni hivyo tu.

00:05:53.255 --> 00:05:57.935
Kwa hiyo, wingu linaweza kuwa gumu. Najua
huenda ulikwama kidogo hapo,

00:05:57.935 --> 00:06:01.336
lakini natumaini ilikuwa
fikra nzuri za kimantiki.

00:06:02.026 --> 00:06:06.105
Na hili, nadhani, ndilo la mwisho
kati ya mazoezi ya kuchora tu.

00:06:06.105 --> 00:06:10.466
Sasa, tutaenda... Hebu nihakikishe
niko sahihi kusema hivi kabla

00:06:10.466 --> 00:06:11.946
sijafokewa kwa kukosea.

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:16.586
Je, kuna mengine? Kuna zoezi la
Nyumba Iliyochanganyika linakuja,

00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:21.815
ambapo tutakuwa tukihamisha
vitu kidogo, lakini,

00:06:21.815 --> 00:06:25.225
hili ndilo la mwisho ambapo utachora
vitu vipya, nina uhakika kabisa.

00:06:25.776 --> 00:06:31.305
Kisha tutaendelea na dhana za kuvutia
zaidi sana, na kuanza

00:06:31.706 --> 00:06:35.466
kuziingiza pia. Kwa hiyo hongera kwa
kuvumilia mazoezi haya.

00:06:35.466 --> 00:06:39.826
Natumaini ujuzi wako wa kutatua
matatizo unaanza kuamka.

00:06:39.826 --> 00:06:43.625
Kama imepita muda tangu ulipofanya
hisabati au mambo kama haya,

00:06:43.786 --> 00:06:46.505
natumaini haya yanaamsha
ubongo wako upya.

00:06:46.745 --> 00:06:48.745
Na kama una uzoefu zaidi kidogo,

00:06:48.745 --> 00:06:51.065
natumaini uliyaona
ya haraka na rahisi pia.

00:06:52.425 --> 00:06:54.826
Kwa hiyo tutaonana tena kwenye zoezi hili hivi karibuni.

00:06:54.826 --> 00:06:55.706
Asante kwa kutazama.
